"<div style=\"margin:auto;background: #FFFFFF;color:#777777\">\n"
"                    <p>Hola</p>\n"
"                    <p>Ha sido invitado a realizar la aprobación del FSN.</p>\n"
"                    <ul>\n"
"                        <li>\n"
"                            FSN: <t t-out=\"object.name\"></t>\n"
"                        </li>\n"
"                        <li>\n"
"                            Portal Access Link:  <a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.document_url }}\"><t t-out=\"object.document_url\"></t></a>\n"
"                        </li>\n"
"                    </ul>\n"
"<!--                    <p>To complete the authorization process, please access our online delegation system to sign and accept the document.</p>-->\n"
